*                                                                               
Z-FINISH. PROC                                                                  
*  SKICKA MAIL ÄVEN OM POSTER SAKNAS                                            
   IF WS-ANTAL = 0                                                              
      DISPLAY W4639BD2 NEWPAGE +                                                
         COL 10 'DIRECT DELIVERIES'                                             
      DISPLAY W4639BD2 SKIP 1  +                                                
         COL 10 'THERE ARE NO LINES ON THE REPORT TODAY'                        
   END-IF                                                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
REPORT   RAPPORT1              +                                                
         PRINTER W4639BD2      +                                                
         DTLCTL EVERY          +                                                
         PAGESIZE 9999         +                                                
         LINESIZE 200          +                                                
         SPACE 0               +                                                
         NOPAGE                +                                                
         NODATE                +                                                
         NOSPREAD              +                                                
         NOADJUST                                                               
*                                                                               
CONTROL  FINAL NOPRINT IN1-IDLEVNR NEWPAGE RENUM                                
